  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Once the Shogun\u2019s greatest protector, Musashi was a master of the
    katana and the lethal shuriken. But ten years ago, when dark forces ravaged the
    kingdom, he watched helplessly as his lord fell. Consumed by guilt, the veteran
    samurai exiled himself to the remote Red Maple Forest, drowning his past in sake.\n\nNow,
    the creeping darkness has reached his final sanctuary. Watching his last drop
    of sake spill onto the tainted earth, Musashi's drunken haze vanishes. He dons
    his old uniform, secures his sake gourd and shurikens, and draws the Shogun\u2019s
    katana\u2014shaking off a decade of dust. The broken man is dead; the legendary
    warrior has returned to collect a ten-year blood debt."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
